<section class="sec" id="how"><div class="wrap"><div class="intro rv"><h2 class="h2">We give you the AI. You bring the judgment.</h2><p class="lede">Run your money like a fund: pick your analysts, hear their pitches, and weigh every idea from both sides.</p></div></div><div class="fcar rv"><div class="fcar-track"><article class="fcard"><div class="ftext"><h3>Skip the consensus</h3><p>Ask AI what a stock is worth and you get consensus, which is already priced in. Funds pay for judgment instead. To paraphrase Galileo, reasoning is racing, not hauling: a hundred farm horses win a haul, but one thoroughbred wins the race.</p></div><div class="appwin"><img src="/images/v2/jd1_good_judgment.webp" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: Skip the consensus" class="shot" style="aspect-ratio:2000/1135;height:auto" width="2000" height="1135" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="fcard"><div class="ftext"><h3>Pick your analysts</h3><p>Olives reward reasoning that holds up in open debate and over time, not luck or hype, and they’re earned asset by asset. Use Olives as a starting point, then build your bench using your own judgment.</p></div><div class="appwin"><img src="/images/v2/jd2_leaderboard.webp" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: Pick your analysts" class="shot" style="aspect-ratio:2000/1138;height:auto" width="2000" height="1138" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="fcard"><div class="ftext"><h3>Chair your investment committee</h3><p>Your analysts pitch you their best ideas, with the reasoning behind them, and alert you when they change their mind. Everyone has access to the same pitches; you produce the alpha by choosing whose ideas to back.</p></div><div class="appwin"><img src="/images/v2/jd3_views.webp" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: Chair your investment committee" class="shot" style="aspect-ratio:2000/1144;height:auto" width="2000" height="1144" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="fcard"><div class="ftext"><h3>John Maven AI, at your service</h3><p>He covers every asset no analyst has claimed yet, and he knows Delphi One inside out. Ask him anything about it, from where the debate is hottest today to which Values moved overnight.</p></div><div class="appwin"><img src="/images/v2/jd4_john_maven.webp" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: John Maven AI, at your service" class="shot" style="aspect-ratio:2000/1140;height:auto" width="2000" height="1140" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article></div>
